        "params": {
          "text": "FM_FREQUENCY_DETECTION\n100 Hz carrier, +/-20 Hz deviation, 2 Hz message; crossing-period detection and 0.02 s smoothing.\nRun 2 s at 10000 Hz; open the scopes.\nEquations, experiments and limits: examples/signal_measurement/README.md.\nExperimental: manual Studio workflow has not been qualified.",
